### Confirmation Rules

1. Only accepted requests can be scheduled.
2. Only authorized donor and recipient accounts can confirm pickup.
3. Each party must confirm collection independently.
4. Once one party confirms, the request remains COLLECTED or awaiting confirmation.
5. Once both parties confirm, the request becomes COMPLETED.
6. Duplicate confirmations must be prevented.
7. Every status update must be recorded with a timestamp.
8. Completed donations cannot be reopened through normal user actions.

Provide a confirmation screen showing the pickup reference and collection details.

