Deliver FoodBridge AI as a complete, modern, responsive, AI-powered food donation and redistribution platform.

A judge must be able to log in as a donor, publish surplus food, log in as a verified NGO, discover and request the food, receive donor approval, coordinate pickup, confirm collection from both sides, and see the completed donation reflected in the platform's history and impact analytics.

